+*   **Alpha Scale:** Multiplier for fragment opacity to adjust visibility [S5, unofficial].
+*   **Lighting Constants:** Ambient ($K_a$), Diffuse ($K_d$), Specular ($K_s$), Shininess, Light positions [S5, unofficial].
